## 🔑 Key Features

✅ **Strict JSON output** — No markdown, no explanations, machine-parseable  
✅ **Topic-weighted ranking** — Direct topics (scheming, deception) prioritized  
✅ **Eligibility filters** — Location, recency, evidence requirements enforced  
✅ **Confidence flags** — Low-confidence entries clearly marked for review  
✅ **Verifiable sources** — Every researcher includes at least one citable URL  

---

## 📐 Output Schema

All responses conform to `schemas/output_schema.json`. Key fields:

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `researchers[].name` | string | Full name |
| `researchers[].relevance_score` | number (0–1) | Weighted relevance score |
| `researchers[].topic_category` | enum | `"direct"` or `"adjacent"` |
| `researchers[].evidence[].url` | URI | Verifiable source link |
| `researchers[].confidence` | enum | `"high"`, `"medium"`, or `"low"` |

🔗 [View full schema](./schemas/output_schema.json)

